// probe: where does the engine find a plugin named by #pragma plugin nvmidi
//
// One line of script, one marker. This file is copied into each candidate
// location and run from there; whichever run prints LOC_OK is a location the
// engine accepts. Nothing else is in the file, so an exit code here is a
// statement about the pragma resolution and nothing about the plugin's API.
#pragma plugin nvmidi

void main() {
	print("LOC_OK");
}
